==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~4.67 seconds<sup>100f~140f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use any generalist nukers like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] to break the Aku Doges' shields and kill him instantly. A good number of meatshields are highly recommended as the level cap forces your unit levels to 1.

Remember that the [[Cat Base]] and the [[Cat Cannon]] are not affected, but the cannon is not needed unless you do not have any generalist nukers.

